    {
      "id": "tldr--16ed77dea912",
      "canonicalPath": "common/chmod.md",
      "locale": "zh-TW",
      "sourceLocale": "zh_TW",
      "name": "chmod",
      "title": "chmod",
      "summary": "修改文件或目錄的存取權限。 使用者類型分為檔案所有者（u）、檔案所有者之群組（g）、以及其他使用者（o）。",
      "platform": "cross-platform",
      "softwareIds": [
        "coreutils--1bc6b0b1",
        "gow--4cb149e7",
        "unxutils--5bef4004"
      ],
      "candidateSoftwareIds": [],
      "exampleCount": 8,
      "examples": [
        {
          "description": "給予文件所有者執行的權限：",
          "command": "chmod u+x {{檔案/完整/路徑}}",
          "line": 9,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/chmod.md#L9"
        },
        {
          "description": "給予使用者讀寫權利：",
          "command": "chmod u+rw {{檔案/完整/路徑}}",
          "line": 13,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/chmod.md#L13"
        },
        {
          "description": "移除群組執行權限：",
          "command": "chmod g-x {{檔案/完整/路徑}}",
          "line": 17,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/chmod.md#L17"
        },
        {
          "description": "給予全部使用者讀與執行權限：",
          "command": "chmod a+rx {{檔案/完整/路徑}}",
          "line": 21,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/chmod.md#L21"
        },
        {
          "description": "給予其他使用者（o）和檔案所有者之群組（g）一樣的權限：",
          "command": "chmod o=g {{檔案/完整/路徑}}",
          "line": 25,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/chmod.md#L25"
        },
        {
          "description": "移除其他使用者（o）的全部權限：",
          "command": "chmod o= {{檔案/完整/路徑}}",
          "line": 29,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/chmod.md#L29"
        },
        {
          "description": "改變目錄底下所有檔案以及目錄的權限，給予檔案所有者之群組寫的權限，以及其他使用者寫的權限：",
          "command": "chmod {{[-R|--recursive]}} g+w,o+w {{目標目錄}}",
          "line": 33,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/chmod.md#L33"
        },
        {
          "description": "改變目錄底下所有檔案以及目錄的權限，給予全部使用者讀與對其底下檔案之執行權限：",
          "command": "chmod {{[-R|--recursive]}} a+rX {{目標目錄}}",
          "line": 37,
          "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/chmod.md#L37"
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": "https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/b64c941c148686ccc00173f7ebb7dc599eeba525/pages.zh_TW/common/chmod.md"
    },
